117→              <p><strong>Per-job inbox:</strong> Each job gets a unique email address. Forward resumes to it and they'll be attached directly to that job.</p>
118→              <p><strong>Fallback inbox:</strong> Your personal inbox above routes resumes to your most recent pending job.</p>
119→              <p><strong>Supported formats:</strong> PDF and DOCX attachments are automatically extracted and uploaded.</p>
